    <briefdescription>
<para>Codec-Agnostic PCM Double-Buffered Audio Playback Engine. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides a zero-malloc, hardware-decoupled PCM streaming engine designed to feed audio samples to microcontroller DMA, I2S, SAI, or DAC peripherals.</para>
<para>Uses double-buffering (ping-pong halves) to allow uninterrupted audio decoding while the hardware transfers the alternate half-buffer to the DAC via DMA. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
